    "text": "By Ryan Epling ,\n6 hours ago KANAWHA COUNTY, W.Va. (WSAZ) - The Hatfield-McCoy trail through Kanawha County will soon be expanded. The Kanawha Parks and Recreation Board on Wednesday voted to expand the single track trail through the Tornado area of the county. The new expansion will take the trail from 35 to 40 miles in... Read full article",
